    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -410,
      "width": 1390,
      "height": 245,
      "text": "# MDSE Knowledge Base — native semantic relationships\n\nLeft: stakeholder requirements; middle: 16 user use cases; right: six reusable logical functions. **Refines** (26): use-case specification elaborates requirement intent. **hasAction** (32): scenario owns a typed action usage; the software performer is modeled separately. **dependsOn** (4): a supporting prerequisite, not refinement. 16 stakeholder needs remain unconnected pending an appropriate scenario. Every line is a derived view of a SysML v2 block; edit the owning note, not the canvas.\n\nEight previous over-broad edges have been omitted, with disposition recorded in the semantic review."
    },
